      "description": "Video Pitch Changer app changes the playback speed (tempo) and key (pitch) of music audio independently.\n\nVideo Pitch Changer app changes the key (pitch) of video music independently. \n\nYou can easily change the pitch of video files on your iPhone device. Useful for practicing songs, or those that need different tunings.\n\nSimple controls and clear visuals make easy to use without compromising accuracy. Modify the pitch, reverb, room size, delay of your video files by simply moving four sliders.\n\nif you move the pitch slider, you will get a high-pitched or low-pitched audio.\n\nApply effects on your audio. By playing with the sliders, you can get a squirrel or evil voice. You can also export your adjusted video song & share with friends or listening in another player.\n\n\nFeatures:\n- Alter the pitch- change song pitch up or down\n- Apply the reverb, delay, room size effect.\n- Support various formats of video files.\n- Export adjusted video song",
